## Exercise 2: estimate weighted mean happiness by country {.smaller}

- `Happy` is the ESS `happy` item (0 = extremely unhappy, 10 = extremely happy)
- Refusal/don't know/no answer codes already recoded to `NA`

Use `ess_des` from Exercise 1 to estimate weighted mean happiness by country.

```{r}
#| label: 06-happy-by-country-exercise
#| echo: false
happy_by_country <-
  ess_des |>
  filter(!is.na(Happy)) |>
  group_by(Country) |>
  summarize(Happy_mean = survey_mean(Happy, na.rm = TRUE))

happy_by_country
